SUMMARY:The Big Fix Open Charity Golf Tournament
LOCATION:Cross Creek Golf Course\, 2321 County Road 490\, Hanceville\, AL
DESCRIPTION:Tee it up for a good cause. This four person scramble raises 
 money for a community spay and neuter program that helps keep healthy\, a
 doptable dogs out of crowded shelters. Breakfast and lunch are included\,
  and there's a silent auction\, a 50/50 raffle and prizes at 1:00 PM. Tim
 e: 7:00 AM registration\, 8:00 AM shotgun start. https://business.cullman
 chamber.org/events/details/the-big-fix-open-24019
